@page "/teams"

<PageTitle>Teams · AVI Robotics</PageTitle>

<PageHero Kicker="Teams" Title="Where the robots get built.">
    <p>AVI is the club. Competition teams form inside it around a specific challenge.</p>
</PageHero>

<section class="section">
    <div class="wrap">
        <ul class="team-list">
            <li class="team-list__item team-list__item--sms">
                <a href="/teams/sms" class="team-list__link">
                    <span class="mono team-list__code">SMS</span>
                    <h2 class="team-list__name">Sequoia Marine Solutions</h2>
                    <span class="team-list__desc">MATE ROV Competition. Underwater remotely operated vehicle.</span>
                    <span class="link-arrow" aria-hidden="true">Team page</span>
                </a>
            </li>
            <li class="team-list__item team-list__item--muted">
                <div class="team-list__link">
                    <span class="mono team-list__code">NEXT</span>
                    <h2 class="team-list__name">Your team here</h2>
                    <span class="team-list__desc">Have a competition in mind? Bring it to a meeting. That's how SMS started.</span>
                </div>
            </li>
        </ul>
    </div>
</section>
